  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-funding organisational cost of Sociedade de Desenvolvimento Urbano (SDUB) 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The subsidy project co-funds the organisational costs of Sociedade de Desenvolvimento Urbano (SDUB) for the years 2023-2027.The co-finance partner is the municipality of Beira, the single shareholder of SDUBeira. The main activities of SDUBeira are to develop land, attract partnerships and investments from national and foreign private sector for the urban development of the city. SDUBeira will focus on the development of housing in the Maraza area, leading to the delivery of the first affordable houses by the year 2025.Main activities are&#x2022;	to mobilise Capital Financing,&#x2022;	to collaborate with private developers to construct the first houses,&#x2022;	to prevent enchroachement of the Maraza area,&#x2022;	to market and sell land and houses,&#x2022;	to engage with potential donors and investors for public services in Maraza and&#x2022;	to transit towards self sustainability through realisation of income revenue from other activities (for example Sand business).Secondly SDUBeira will further develop the Munhave Industrial Park (MIP) business case and the Port Access Road project.</narrative>
  </description>
